      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love for this to be added so I can put down my controllers to charge and use the trackers with hand tracking when I am socialising / relaxing in VR.  This will help as I spend so much time in VR and switching between Controllers or slowly charging can be annoying. This will be so convenient and great!!",
